// ---- decimal parsing ------------------------------------------------------

// decimalTokenRe matches the exact grammar accepted for modulus, coefficients
// and input values: an optional single '-' followed by one or more digits.
// json.Number or strconv would also accept '+' and underscores, so parse
// manually.
